      "value": "<p>At 4th level and every three levels thereafter, the gambler can select one gambit. These abilities employ the gambler's MGP to change the tide of battle. Once a gambit is selected, it cannot be changed later. Unless specified otherwise, a gambler cannot select the same gambit more than once, nor can he utilize a gambit that would result in him expending an amount of MGP greater than his gambler level.</p>",
